# Isolated fixture: production artifact bridge and page, fake delivery; never real agents.
# Prerequisite: -PartifactPreview :artifact-preview:assembleDebug installed.
clearlog
shell am instrument -w dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.ReceiptInstrumentation
log artifact receipt signature PASS
nolog artifact receipt FAIL
fold folded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --ez questions true
expect listening-room.html
tap listening-room.html
expect Where should the question form open?
tap Beside chat
scrollto Which screen sizes should we check?
tap Cover
tap Unfolded
scrollto submit answers
shot questions-cover-ready
clearlog
tap submit answers
expect Sent to phone:A
log artifact answer 1 to phone:A
nolog artifact answer 2
shot questions-cover-sent
fold open
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --ez questions true
tap listening-room.html
expect Where should the question form open?
tap Full screen
scrollto Which screen sizes should we check?
tap Cover
scrollto submit answers
shot questions-unfolded-ready
clearlog
tap submit answers
expect Sent to phone:A
log artifact answer 1 to phone:A
nolog artifact answer 2
shot questions-unfolded-sent
[phone] In a real agent mockup, choose options and Other, Submit once. It stays in the artifact and shows Sent to the declared agent only after delivery; verify that agent received exactly those answers plus source and native receipt. Repeat with a known Mac thread; unreachable runner reports unconfirmed, never sent. Verify double taps/reload do not duplicate, no second review/card, no hidden script/frame/live-URL delivery, and no soma.approve API.
